        <h1>Administrator help centre</h1>
        <p>This guide explains the administrator portal in everyday language: what each area is for, how records move through the school, how marks and reports are handled, and what to check before making changes.</p>
        <p>Administrators coordinate the process. Teachers submit marks and attendance through their staff portal; administrators review, resolve setup issues, and control when official reports are approved.</p>
